{"id":1194,"level":75,"name":"Відволікання (1)","group":"Тактика: підсумок","format":27,"description":"<p>When considering possible moves in a chess game position, always look for weak enemy pieces. Which pieces are vulnerable? Could you remove the defending piece by means of a deflection?</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Deflect defenders and win material. First, look for the defenders. Then decide on how to remove them.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":84,"examples":[{"fen":"8/3R3p/p3r1pk/6q1/8/1P5P/5PP1/2Q3K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yg5][%cal Gh6g5]} 1. Rxh7+ {[%csl Rg5][%cal Gh6g5,Yh7h6]} Kxh7 2. Qxg5 1-0","text":"<p>Білі можуть виграти матеріал красивою жертвою тури. Після того, як короля вигнали, чорний ферзь більше не захищається.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":41266,"fen":"8/r3b3/2p5/2p2k2/2P1N3/p2KP3/R7/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye4][%cal Gd3e4]} 1... Rd7+ 2. Kc3 Kxe4 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41113,"fen":"R7/5k2/5r2/6K1/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yf6]} 1. Ra7+ Ke6 2. Ra6+ Ke5 3. Rxf6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41179,"fen":"2R5/1k4rp/1p2B1p1/p1b2p2/1p3P1P/1P2P3/P3KP2/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc8][%cal Ge6c8]} 1... Re7 2. Rh8 Rxe6 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49993,"fen":"r1r3k1/6p1/1B2ppq1/p2b1n1p/1p3P2/1P1B3Q/P1PR2PP/4R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd5,Yf5][%cal Ge6d5,Ye6f5]} 1. Bxf5 exf5 2. Rxd5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41228,"fen":"5bk1/5p1p/6p1/4p3/2b5/2P2BP1/4NP1P/6K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye2][%cal Gf3e2]} 1... e4 2. Bxe4 (2. Bg4 f5) 2... Bxe2 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41464,"fen":"8/p3kp2/1p2p3/1P3p1p/P1B2P2/1P2b1P1/1K4RP/2r5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc1][%cal Ge3c1]} 1. Re2 {[%csl Re3][%cal Ge3c1,Ye2e3]} Bc5 {[%csl Yc1]} 2. Kxc1 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"